</div><div class="flex-cols">    <div class="component header col-12">
        <div class="component-content">
<h4 class="field-header">Watch the event recording</h4>        </div>
    </div>

    <div  class="component cf-promo col-12">
        <div class="component-content">

    

    <div class="field-image"><a class="link-button__anchor" title=""  target='_self'  href="/events/fedtalk/2026/ft-20260716-monetary-policy-in-american-history">
                 <img src="/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/homepage/fed-talk-footer-image.png?w=364&hash=E8C3A7095DC8B4B85FD5F0A8C09D439A" alt="Fed Talk 2026" sizes="(min-width:992px) 557px,364px" srcset="/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/homepage/fed-talk-footer-image.png?w=557&amp;hash=8C9276147A6393282705D70E0A2C062E 557w,/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/homepage/fed-talk-footer-image.png?w=364&amp;hash=E8C3A7095DC8B4B85FD5F0A8C09D439A 364w" />
            </a></div>


    <div class="field-description"><p>Explore the resources from our Fed Talk, "The Crises That Led to the Fed&rsquo;s Creation: Monetary Policy in American History." </p></div>
